# CDN edge — reachable ONLY through the allowlisting relay (squid), never
# directly from the lab. Populated 2026-11-08 on explicit operator instruction:
# "allow cloudflare, gitbook, fastly for exploration".
#
# Why this is separate from scope.allow: the lab (in_scope) stays on the client's hosting provider only,
# so a tool that ignores HTTP_PROXY cannot reach the CDN. squid's dstdomain ACL is
# what narrows ~1.9M shared-edge addresses back down to the client's names.
#
# GitBook is not a network: gitbook.io, api./app./hosting.gitbook.io and the
# client's docs host all resolve into the Cloudflare prefixes below.
#
